    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="42559b18-7dfb-590f-bd1c-2998194766e3" activityNameId="4360af0f-2bc9-5175-96c8-1e4596052e20" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, ventilation system, Geschäftshaus C, Esslingen, special components</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, ventilation system, Geschäftshaus C, Esslingen, special components
Disposal of special components of a ventilation system for an office building with offices only (no kitchen, restaurant or car park). The inventory is based on a building with a total heated gross floor area of 2621 m2 and a total nominal air flow of 4000 m3/h, total weight of the components: 121 kg/Unit, building with a specific air flow rate of 1.5 m3/h per m2 heated gross floor area. Data from call of bid including decental ventilation units between circulation area and offices. Components including fans, wiring and transformer but without surrounding light-weight wall.;
UUID: 483c8d29-e040-414a-a1ca-c50e74ab577e
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_483c8d29-e040-414a-a1ca-c50e74ab577e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
